FR:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Hé !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Allô, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ? J'ai dit
« Hé » !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} On peut savoir ce qui te
prend ? Arrête de me bousculer !{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}It really hurts that you keep pushing
me around like that!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}If you need me for something,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
use your words!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} You don't have
to shove me!{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Tu crois que c'est agréable d'être
bousculé dans tous les sens ?
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Pourquoi tu fais ça ?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Si t'as besoin de quelque chose,
utilise ta bouche !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Non mais quel{{TAG:000E:0006:000004006C006500}}
sauvage, je vous jure !{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Beni öyle itip durman gerçekten canımı
acıtıyor!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bir şey istiyorsan,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} konuş!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
İtmek zorunda değilsin!{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}If I'm in your way,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} say something!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}It's really horrible to push people
around like that,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Si te estoy molestando,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} dímelo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}¡Me parece muy mal que empujes
así a los demás,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}On t'a jamais appris la politesse ?
{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Pousser les gens pour passer, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}on
aura tout vu,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Se ti intralcio il cammino,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} dillo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Non mi sembra carino spingere
la gente così,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000B:0004:03CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Wenn ich dir im Weg bin, dann sag
